@host = http://localhost:5187

# Story 06: Sample rows are department-scoped; requests run as agentA (Riyadh Customer Care). Expected results
# below are otherwise unchanged from Story 02.
@agentA = 06000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000003

# Story 07: requests run as agent A, signed in below (access tokens expire after 2 minutes in Development -
# re-run the login when a request answers 401). Password: Identity:DevSeed:Password in appsettings.Development.json.
### Login as agent A
# @name loginAgentA
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "agent.a@crm.local", "password": "Crm_Dev_2026!" }

@agentAToken = {{loginAgentA.response.body.accessToken}}

### Create a sample — 200, echoes createdBy/createdAtUtc
POST {{host}}/api/Admin/Samples
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "name": "Round trip", "lines": ["first", "second"] }

### Read it back — value object and child both present
GET {{host}}/api/Admin/Samples/{{sampleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### Update — populates modifiedBy/modifiedAtUtc, bumps rowVersion.
### rowVersion is a base64 byte[]; send back exactly what the GET returned.
PUT {{host}}/api/Admin/Samples/{{sampleId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "name": "Renamed", "rowVersion": "{{rowVersion}}" }

### Stale rowVersion — 409, NOT 500
PUT {{host}}/api/Admin/Samples/{{sampleId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "name": "Conflicting", "rowVersion": "AAAAAAAAB9E=" }

### Soft delete — 204, no SQL DELETE in the EF log
DELETE {{host}}/api/Admin/Samples/{{sampleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### Gone from the default query — 404
GET {{host}}/api/Admin/Samples/{{sampleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### Arabic value object round-trips unmangled
POST {{host}}/api/Admin/Samples
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "name": "عميل تجريبي", "lines": ["سطر أول"] }

### Canonical query slice, now on a controller — 200 (Agent/Sample is not organisation-scoped, no header needed)
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Sample?name=Ahmed
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### Validation still returns RFC 9457 with field errors — 400
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Sample?name=
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}
